referenceFunction.generalComment:
May only be used as Input for the module "bentonite, at mine". It is assumed that the total of mined material is immediately refilled (from on side to the other...). Therefore half of the total amount of diesel is allocated to this recultivation module.;
Synonyms: Renaturierung; 
